{
  "info": {
    "name": "tubodega — API v1",
    "description": "Contrato público de tubodega (MVP solo-API). Estado: Plan 2 — la WAVE 1 completa: registro, sesiones (login, refresh, logout), equipo (`/v1/users`), cambio de contraseña e idempotencia.\n\nFlujo sugerido: 1) Registrar organización → guarda orgId; 2) Login → guarda accessToken y refreshToken; 3) /me; 4) Equipo → crea a Juan y guarda juanId y juanVersion; 5) los casos de error.\n\nLas variables `slug`, `email` y `password` se generan solas si están vacías (pre-request de la colección) para que cada corrida cree una organización nueva. El pre-request también genera una `Idempotency-Key` nueva en cada POST, salvo donde la petición fija una a mano para demostrar el replay.\n\nTodo POST exige `Idempotency-Key` salvo /v1/organizations, /v1/auth/login, /v1/auth/refresh y /v1/auth/logout. Todo error llega como application/problem+json (RFC 9457) con `type`, `title`, `status`, `detail`, `instance`, `traceId` y `errors[]`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000"
    },
    {
      "key": "slug",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "email",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "value": "correcthorse1"
    },
    {
      "key": "orgId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "refreshToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "juanId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "juanVersion",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "replayKey",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "idemKey",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Una organización nueva por corrida: slug y correo únicos si no se fijaron a mano.",
          "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('slug')) {",
          "  const suffix = Date.now().toString(36);",
          "  pm.collectionVariables.set('slug', `la-esquina-${suffix}`);",
          "  pm.collectionVariables.set('email', `marta-${suffix}@esquina.co`);",
          "}",
          "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('email')) {",
          "  pm.collectionVariables.set('email', `marta-${pm.collectionVariables.get('slug')}@esquina.co`);",
          "}",
          "",
          "// Idempotency-Key nueva por POST: la petición que quiera demostrar el replay",
          "// fija {{replayKey}} a mano y esta línea no la pisa.",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('idemKey', pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "pm.test('X-Request-Id es un UUID', () => {",
          "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('X-Request-Id')).to.match(/^[0-9a-f-]{36}$/i);",
          "});",
          "if (pm.response.code >= 400) {",
          "  pm.test('los errores son application/problem+json', () => {",
          "    pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type')).to.include('application/problem+json');",
          "    const p = pm.response.json();",
          "    pm.expect(p).to.include.keys('type', 'title', 'status', 'detail', 'instance', 'traceId');",
          "    pm.expect(p.traceId).to.eql(pm.response.headers.get('X-Request-Id'));",
          "  });",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Organizaciones",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Registrar organización",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created con Location', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location')).to.match(/^\\/v1\\/organizations\\//);",
                  "});",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('orgId', body.organization.id);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', body.owner.id);",
                  "pm.test('el owner tiene el rol OWNER', () => pm.expect(body.owner.roles).to.eql(['OWNER']));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/organizations",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "organizations"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Registro público. Crea la organización y su primer OWNER en una sola transacción. Exento de Idempotency-Key (spec 07 §5). Errores: 400 validation-failed, 409 slug-taken, 422 invalid-slug / invalid-email.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Distribuidora La Esquina\",\n  \"slug\": \"{{slug}}\",\n  \"owner\": {\n    \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n    \"name\": \"Marta\",\n    \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Autenticación",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 con par de tokens', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(b.accessToken).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.expect(b.refreshToken).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.expect(b.expiresIn).to.eql(900);",
                  "});",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', b.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', b.refreshToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', b.user.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Devuelve accessToken (JWT HS256, 15 min) y refreshToken (opaco, 30 días; se rota en cada uso). `slug` es opcional: obligatorio solo si el correo existe en varias organizaciones (409 ambiguous-login). Correo inexistente, contraseña errónea y usuario inactivo responden lo mismo: 401 invalid-credentials.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login con slug (correo en varias organizaciones)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "La misma persona puede pertenecer a dos negocios (T-1 es por organización). Sin `slug` el login es 409 ambiguous-login; con `slug` resuelve.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"slug\": \"{{slug}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh — rota el par",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "content-type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/refresh",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "refresh"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Exento de Idempotency-Key. El token de refresco es de un solo uso: al usarlo queda revocado.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', b.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', b.refreshToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout — revoca el token de refresco",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "content-type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "logout"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Exento de Idempotency-Key. Responde 204 aunque el token no exista: no revela cuáles existen.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('204', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Perfil",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Mi usuario y organización",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 con usuario y organización', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(b.user.id).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('userId'));",
                  "  pm.expect(b.organization.id).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('orgId'));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/me",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Requiere Bearer. Los roles vienen de la base de datos, no del token: desactivar un usuario o retirarle un rol surte efecto en la siguiente petición (T-6). Errores: 401 invalid-credentials (sin token, token inválido o usuario inactivo), 401 token-expired."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cambiar mi contraseña",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "content-type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "idempotency-key",
                "value": "{{idemKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/me/password",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "me",
                "password"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Exige la contraseña actual. Las sesiones abiertas siguen valiendo.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"current\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"next\": \"unmejorsecreto9\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('204', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Equipo",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear a Juan (OPERATOR)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "content-type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "idempotency-key",
                "value": "{{idemKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/users",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "users"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Exige Idempotency-Key. Devuelve 201 con Location.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"juan-{{slug}}@esquina.co\",\n  \"name\": \"Juan\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"roles\": [\n    \"OPERATOR\"\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 con Location', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('location')).to.be.a('string');",
                  "});",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('juanId', b.id);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('juanVersion', 1);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('replayKey', pm.request.headers.get('idempotency-key'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Reintento con la misma clave → replay",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "content-type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "idempotency-key",
                "value": "{{replayKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/users",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "users"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Mismo cuerpo y misma clave: devuelve la respuesta guardada, sin crear un segundo usuario.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"juan-{{slug}}@esquina.co\",\n  \"name\": \"Juan\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"roles\": [\n    \"OPERATOR\"\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('replay con la misma respuesta', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('idempotency-replayed')).to.eql('true');",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().id).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('juanId'));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar el equipo",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/users?sort=name&limit=50",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "users"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "sort",
                  "value": "name"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "50"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Filtros admitidos: active, role. Orden: name, email (prefijo - para descendente)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 con envoltorio de página', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(b).to.have.property('data');",
                  "  pm.expect(b.page).to.have.property('hasMore');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Filtrar por rol",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/users?role=OPERATOR",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "users"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "role",
                  "value": "OPERATOR"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('solo operarios', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  pm.response.json().data.forEach((u) => pm.expect(u.roles).to.include('OPERATOR'));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Un usuario por id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/users/{{juanId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "users",
                "{{juanId}}"
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('juanVersion', 1);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Cambiar roles (If-Match)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "content-type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "if-match",
                "value": "\"{{juanVersion}}\""
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/users/{{juanId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "users",
                "{{juanId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "If-Match es obligatorio: sin él, 400 missing-if-match; con una versión vieja, 409 stale-version.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"roles\": [\n    \"ADMIN\"\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('juanVersion', 2);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Desactivar a Juan",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/users/{{juanId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "users",
                "{{juanId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Desactiva, no borra: los movimientos referencian a su actor."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('204', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Contrato",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "OpenAPI (JSON)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('documento OpenAPI con las rutas v1', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const paths = Object.keys(pm.response.json().paths);",
                  "  pm.expect(paths).to.include.members(['/v1/organizations', '/v1/auth/login', '/v1/me']);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/openapi.json",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "openapi.json"
              ]
            },
            "description": "El contrato generado desde el código (spec 03 §10). Público."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Casos de error (para ver problem+json)",
      "description": "Peticiones que fallan a propósito. Cada una demuestra la forma RFC 9457 y un `type` estable del contrato.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "409 slug-taken — registrar el mismo slug otra vez",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('409 slug-taken', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(409);",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().type).to.eql('https://tubodega.app/errors/slug-taken');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
